# Async task state machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Running: poll
  Running --> WaitingClock: tick().await
  Running --> WaitingDelta: delta_yield().await
  Running --> Completed: future ends
  WaitingClock --> Ready: Clock::advance()
  WaitingDelta --> Ready: next poll pass
  WaitingClock --> XInjected: oscillation detected
  XInjected --> Ready: downstream stabilizes
  Completed --> [*]
```
